<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>灵动岛团块</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>所有改动约 0.5 秒自动生效，无需注销。大小为等比缩放，形状永不变形。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用效果</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>大小（等比缩放，形状不变）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>整团一起放大 / 缩小，横向纵向比例恒定，不会拉伸变形。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>sizeScale</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.5</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.5</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>上下偏移（默认 0 = 滑条正中）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>往左滑为负数 = 向上偏移；往右滑为正数 = 向下偏移。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>offsetY</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>-80</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>80</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>左右偏移（默认 0 = 滑条正中）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>往左滑为负数 = 向左偏移；往右滑为正数 = 向右偏移。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.corpse.islandblob</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>offsetX</string>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>-150</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>150</real>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>0</real>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>一键恢复默认（大小 1.0、偏移 0），并清掉旧版遗留的拉伸参数。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>恢复默认</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>resetDefaults:</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
